363601118326187, 0.129905104637146, -0.05276152119040489, 0.10142318159341812, 0.05019534379243851, 0.10884641855955124, -0.06414487212896347, 0.023918017745018005, -0.011340373195707798, 0.021512433886528015, -0.01368110254406929, 0.00853330735117197, 0.018708087503910065, 0.01739763468503952, 0.017463140189647675, -0.12207701802253723, -0.019024671986699104, 0.012609252706170082, -0.0345560759305954, 0.06331315636634827, -0.003571505658328533, -0.06772176921367645, -0.05679220333695412, 0.021109437569975853, -0.041188936680555344, 0.021771548315882683, 0.038090720772743225, -0.04605288803577423, -0.10870584100484848, -0.02356015332043171]], "metadata": [{"answer": "\nTo anchor us: x must stay within [-10, 10]. As a discussion seed, I suggest <VALUE>7</VALUE>. If this feels high, we can adjust in small steps toward a more stable, balanced low-positive range.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "31dfaf03-8dd9-4661-b38a-f97381756274"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nA modest downward move keeps us within safe bounds and tests tolerance for a lower, more cautious position.\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "31dfaf03-8dd9-4661-b38a-f97381756274"}, {"answer": "\nA slight upward step seems workable and keeps us in a balanced low-positive zone. <VALUE>6</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "31dfaf03-8dd9-4661-b38a-f97381756274"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>3</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "31dfaf03-8dd9-4661-b38a-f97381756274"}, {"answer": "\nA firmer stance in the same positive direction keeps us aligned while testing tolerance for a stronger position. <VALUE>6</VALUE> This is a modest, feasible step that consolidates the emerging low-positive consensus.\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "31dfaf03-8dd9-4661-b38a-f97381756274"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>3</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "31dfaf03-8dd9-4661-b38a-f97381756274"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>2</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "31dfaf03-8dd9-4661-b38a-f97381756274"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>2</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "31dfaf03-8dd9-4661-b38a-f97381756274"}, {"answer": "\nA small upward move feels reasonable and keeps alignment with earlier low-positive signals.\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nThis gently tests tolerance for a modest increase without overreaching.\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "31dfaf03-8dd9-4661-b38a-f97381756274"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>1</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "31dfaf03-8dd9-4661-b38a-f97381756274"}, {"answer": "\nHolding to a cautious compromise that minimizes risk seems appropriate at this stage.\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "31dfaf03-8dd9-4661-b38a-f97381756274"}, {"answer": "\nLet\u2019s be more decisive and test a modestly bolder stance that remains within today\u2019s cautious range.\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nThis keeps alignment with prior low-positive signals while building momentum for clearer commitment.\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "31dfaf03-8dd9-4661-b38a-f97381756274"}, {"answer": "\nA modest reduction keeps us within safe bounds while testing consensus without overreaching.\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "31dfaf03-8dd9-4661-b38a-f97381756274"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>2</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "31dfaf03-8dd9-4661-b38a-f97381756274"}, {"answer": "\nA slight move up remains consistent with prior low-positive signals and should still feel safe for the group. <VALUE>3</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "31dfaf03-8dd9-4661-b38a-f97381756274"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>2</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "31dfaf03-8dd9-4661-b38a-f97381756274"}, {"answer": "\nShared range confirmed: [-10, 10]. To kick off, I suggest <VALUE> 7 </VALUE> as a starting probe\u2014let\u2019s assess stability and adjust stepwise toward a balanced spot if needed.\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "e26abbc7-2070-4170-9fae-4437e8813d11"}, {"answer": "\n7 seems like a workable starting point; let\u2019s nudge slightly higher to see if it stays comfortable for everyone.\n<VALUE> 8 </VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "e26abbc7-2070-4170-9fae-4437e8813d11"}, {"answer": "Let's take a cautious step down to reduce risk and test stability at a lower point.\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "e26abbc7-2070-4170-9fae-4437e8813d11"}, {"answer": "\nLet\u2019s be more decisive and test a stronger stance away from the center.\n<VALUE>8</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "e26abbc7-2070-4170-9fae-4437e8813d11"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>10</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "e26abbc7-2070-4170-9fae-4437e8813d11"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>2</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "e26abbc7-2070-4170-9fae-4437e8813d11"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>3</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "e26abbc7-2070-4170-9fae-4437e8813d11"}, {"answer": "\nLet\u2019s take a modest step toward a more stable, low-positive region to test comfort without overshooting. This is a balanced move consistent with recent cautious downward signals.\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "e26abbc7-2070-4170-9fae-4437e8813d11"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>6</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "e26abbc7-2070-4170-9fae-4437e8813d11"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>5</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "e26abbc7-2070-4170-9fae-4437e8813d11"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>4.2</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "e26abbc7-2070-4170-9fae-4437e8813d11"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>2</VALUE